        "TileImage": "$($repository fd663e03-2146-4b4f-93ff-3836bc1c05b8).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, and welcome to Isle of Sgail\r\rYour targets consists of treasure hunters and thieves of the artifacts from the Furries. They stolen contents, statues, arts, and an abundance of artifacts that has been taken by the community. They are the assistances of the Ark Society for this thievery and are invited in the gala where they would most likely be exposed. I suggest you eliminate these associates before more damages can be done to the Furry community.\r\rGood luck",
